⍝ ==== s2 check pass (spec §4–§12): the same checks, messages and --check
⍝ traces as s1's trith/src/check.uh, over the heap of heap.trhx. The token
⍝ buffer and the item tree are copied into the heap; token slots below are
⍝ absolute heap slots (−1: none), tree nodes are relative to register 5.
⍝ An error prints its message and ends the program (status 1).

⍝ ---- tokens and tree nodes

⦃
  ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C̵ #4# ‹rd› ⧖:C,tb
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:t ⧗:tb ⊞ ⧗:t #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹tabs› ⸫

⦃ ⧖:C,i,k ⧗:C̵ #5# ‹rd› ⧖:C,ab ⧗:C̵ ⧗:ab ⧗:i ⊞ ⧗:k ⊞ ‹rd› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹nd› ⸫
⍝ ‹ndt› C i: the absolute token of node i
⦃ ⧖:C,i ⧗:C̵,i △ ‹nd› ‹tabs› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ndt› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,t,k ⧗:C̵ ⧗:t ⧗:k ⊞ ‹rd› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹tf› ⸫
⍝ ‹tkd› C t: the kind of token t, 0 for none
⦃ ⧖:C,t ⧗:C̵,t ⧗:t #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ‹tf› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹tkd› ⸫
⍝ ‹tis1› C t kind cp: token t has this kind and the one-code-point text cp
⦃
  ⧖:C,t,kind,cp
  ⧗:C̵,t ‹tkd› ⧖:C,k ⧗:C̵,t #7# ‹tf› ⧖:C,n ⧗:C̵,t #8# ‹tf› ⧖:C,c
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:k ⧗:kind ᛖ ⧗:n △ ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:c ⧗:cp ᛖ ⋎
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹tis1› ⸫
⍝ ‹tc0› C t: the first code point of token t's text
⦃ #8# ‹tf› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹tc0› ⸫

⍝ ‹ptx› C t: print the text of token t
⦃
  ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C̵,t #7# ‹tf› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:t #8# ⊞ ⧗:t #8# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,j,end
    ⧗:C̵,j,end ⧗:j ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⧖:C,j,end ⧗:C̵,j ‹rd› ᚢ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:end ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ptx› ⸫

⍝ ‹plab› C t: print token t as written (s1's ck_label), or ? for none
⦃
  ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C̵,t ⧗:t #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ $?$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ‹plab1› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹plab› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C̵,t #7# ‹tf› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:t #8# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,rn
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:t #9# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞ ⧗:t #9# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞ ⧗:rn ⊞
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,j,end
    ⧗:C̵,j,end ⧗:j ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⧖:C,j,end ⧗:C̵,j ‹rd› ᚢ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:end ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹plab1› ⸫

⍝ ‹trole› C t: the case role of token t: α β γ → 0 1 2, or −1
⦃
  ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C̵,t ‹tkd› ⧖:C,k
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:t #3# ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,m
  ⧗:C̵ #-1# ⧗:m #128# ⋒ ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:m #64# ⋒ ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:m #32# ⋒ ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:t #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹trole› ⸫

⍝ ‹tmark› C t bit: token t carries the mark bit
⦃ ⧖:C,t,bit ⧗:C̵,t #3# ‹tf› ⧖:C,m ⧗:C̵ ⧗:m ⧗:bit ⋒ ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹tmark› ⸫

⍝ ‹tname› C t: the name string of a function name token (⌁ before an antiparticle's)
⦃
  ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C̵,t ‹tkd› ⧖:C,k
  ⧗:C̵,t #7# ‹tf› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵ ‹sbeg› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:C̵,e ⧗:k #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ #8961# ‹scp› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:e ⧗:t #8# ⊞ ⧗:t #8# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,e,j,end
    ⧗:C̵,e,j,end ⧗:j ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,e,j,end ⧗:C̵,j ‹rd› ⧖:C,c ⧗:C̵,e,c ‹scp› ⧗:e ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:end ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⧗:e ‹send›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹tname› ⸫

⍝ ---- errors and traces

⍝ ‹cerr› C t: "path:line:col: error: " for token t (the file and coordinates of a plane cell, A.1.2)
⦃
  ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C̵ #6# ‹rd› ⧖:C,path
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:t ⧗:t #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ○ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:t2 ⧗:t2 △ ‹tf› ⧖:a ⧗:t2 #2# ‹tf› ⧖:b ⧗:a,b ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,ln,cl
  ⧗:C̵,path ⧗:ln ⧗:ln ‹isplane› ⋔ ⦃ ‹plf› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ⁼ ‹sprseg› ⧖:C
  ⧗:ln,cl ⧗:t #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ $:$ ⎙̵ ‹plpos› ⦄ ⁼
  $: error: $ ⎙̵ ⧗:C̵
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cerr› ⸫
⍝ ‹die› C: end the message and stop
⍝ inside an instance of a generic function (register 56), it says which one (§9.4)
⦃
  ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ #56# ‹reg› ⧖:C,w
  ⧗:C̵,w ⧗:w #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:C,ww $ (in $ ⎙̵ ⧗:C̵,ww ‹spr› $)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⁼
  $\n$ ⎙̵ △ ‹exit›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹die› ⸫

⍝ ‹pind› n: 2n spaces (from the parser)
⍝ ‹tron› C: tracing is on
⦃ △ ‹reg› △ ᛖ ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹tron› ⸫

⍝ ‹pvstr› C v: a value's type with its evidential and charge
⦃
  ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:v #6# ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,ev
  ⧗:ev #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⸮$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:ev △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⁖$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⧗:C̵,v ‹rd› ‹spr›
  ⧗:v #7# ⊞ ‹rd› ⧖:C,ch
  ⧗:C̵,ch #16# ‹tis› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵,ch #17# ‹tis› ⧖:C,g
  ⧗:C̵,ch ⧗:e ⧗:g ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ $⁽$ ⎙̵ ‹spr› $⁾$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹pvstr› ⸫

⍝ ‹plist› C L kind: "[a b]" of values (kind 1) or of types (kind 0)
⦃
  ⧖:C,L,kind
  $[$ ⎙̵
  ⧗:C̵,L ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,L,kind ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,L,kind,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,L,kind,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,L,kind,j,n
        ⧗:j ○ ≶ ⋔ ∅ ⦃ $ $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅
        ⧗:C̵,L,j ‹lget› ⧗:kind △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹pvstr› ⦄ ⦃ ‹spr› ⦄ ⁼
        ⧗:L,kind ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
  $]$ ⎙̵
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹plist› ⸫

⍝ ‹trace› C ind t S: "label  ⊢ [stack]" for an op whose label is its token
⦃
  ⧖:C,ind,t,S
  ⧗:C̵ ‹tron› ⧖:C,on
  ⧗:C̵,ind,t,S ⧗:on ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:C,ind,t,S ⧗:ind ‹pind› ⧗:C̵,t ‹plab› ⧗:S ‹trtail› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹trace› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,S $  ⊢ $ ⎙̵ ⧗:C̵,S △ ‹plist› $\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹trtail› ⸫

⍝ ‹tracek› C ind code S: a trace line with a fixed label: 1 ⋔ (join), 2 ⋔⇋ (join),
⍝ 3 ⥀ (exit), 4 ⁇ (join), 5 ⊨, 6 ⟦…⟧, 7 ⟜, 8 ⟜ (retrocausal: filters the moment)
⦃
  ⧖:C,ind,code,S
  ⧗:C̵ ‹tron› ⧖:C,on
  ⧗:C̵,S,ind,code ⧗:on ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:C,S,ind,code ⧗:ind ‹pind› ⧗:code ‹pcodelab› ⧗:C̵,S ‹trtail› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹tracek› ⸫
⦃
  ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⋔ (join)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⋔⇋ (join)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⥀ (exit)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #4# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⁇ (join)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #5# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⊨$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #6# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⟦…⟧$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #7# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⟜$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  #8# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⟜ (retrocausal: filters the moment)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pcodelab› ⸫

⍝ ‹note› C ind code: a note line: 1 attest, 2 face ⦶, 3 face ⊕, 4 face ⊖,
⍝ 5 assert, 6 body, 7 ok, 8 fail, 9 prayer, 10 elements, 11 post-select
⦃
  ⧖:C,ind,code
  ⧗:C̵ ‹tron› ⧖:C,on
  ⧗:ind,code ⧗:on ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:ind,code ⧗:ind ‹pind› ⧗:code ‹pnote› $\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:C̵
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹note› ⸫
⦃
  ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $attest$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $face ⦶$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $face ⊕$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #4# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $face ⊖$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #5# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $assert$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #6# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $body$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #7# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $ok$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #8# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $fail$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #9# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $prayer$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  ⍿⁰ #10# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $elements$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  #11# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $post-select$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹pnote› ⸫

⍝ ---- types written in the tree

⍝ ‹sapptok› C e t from to full: append text code points from … to−1 of token t (dropping ⸮ ⁖ unless full)
⦃
  ⧖:C,e,t,from,to,full
  ⧗:C̵,e,full ⧗:t #8# ⊞ ⧗:from ⊞ ⧗:t #8# ⊞ ⧗:to ⊞
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,e,full,j,end
    ⧗:C̵,e,full,j,end ⧗:j ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,e,full,j,end ⧗:C̵,j ‹rd› ⧖:C,c
        ⧗:C̵,e,c ⧗:full △ ᛖ ⧗:c #11822# ᛖ ‹not› ⧗:c #8278# ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ‹scp› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
        ⧗:e,full ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:end ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹sapptok› ⸫

⍝ ‹tcfactor› C i to e1 … e6: one charge factor of a type token
⦃
  ⧖:C,i,to,e1,e2,e3,e4,e5,e6
  ⧗:C̵ ⟗ ⧗:i,to ‹chparse› ⧖:i2,f,sgn,e,have ⧖:C
  ⧗:sgn ⧗:e ⧗:have △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⊠ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:x
  ⧗:C̵,i2,to
  ⧗:e1 ⧗:x ⧗:f △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:e2 ⧗:x ⧗:f #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:e3 ⧗:x ⧗:f #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:e4 ⧗:x ⧗:f #4# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:e5 ⧗:x ⧗:f #5# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:e6 ⧗:x ⧗:f #6# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹tcfactor› ⸫

⍝ ‹tokcharge› C bt: the canonical charge of type token bt ("" when it has none)
⦃
  ⧖:C,bt
  ⧗:C̵,bt #6# ‹tf› ⧖:C,copen ⧗:C̵,bt #7# ‹tf› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,bt ⧗:copen ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ‹tokcharge1› ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⌁ #16# ‹reg› ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹tokcharge› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,bt
  ⧗:C̵,bt #6# ‹tf› ⧖:C,copen ⧗:C̵,bt #7# ‹tf› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:bt #9# ⊞ ⧗:copen ⊞ ⧗:bt #7# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,i,to,e1,e2,e3,e4,e5,e6
    ⧗:C̵,i,to,e1,e2,e3,e4,e5,e6 ⧗:i ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹tcfactor› ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,i,to,e1,e2,e3,e4,e5,e6 ⧗:C̵,e1,e2,e3,e4,e5,e6 ‹chfmt›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹tokcharge1› ⸫

⍝ ‹sapppfx› C e i np full: append the prefix tokens of type node i
⦃
  ⧖:C,e,i,np,full
  ⧗:C̵,e,i,full ○ ⧗:np
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,e,i,full,j,np
    ⧗:C̵,e,i,full,j,np ⧗:j ⧗:np ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,e,i,full,j,np
        ⧗:C̵,i ⧗:j #4# ⊞ ‹nd› ‹tabs› ⧖:C,t ⧗:C̵,t #7# ‹tf› ⧖:C,n
        ⧗:C̵,e,t ○ ⧗:n ⧗:full ‹sapptok›
        ⧗:e,i,full ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:np ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹sapppfx› ⸫

⍝ ‹sappbase› C e bt k full elem: append the base of a type (token bt of kind k)
⦃
  ⧖:C,e,bt,k,full,elem
  ⧗:C̵,bt #8# ‹tf› ⧖:C,b0
  ⧗:C̵,bt #6# ‹tf› ⧖:C,copen ⧗:C̵,bt #7# ‹tf› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:n ⧗:copen ⧗:copen ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⧖:end
  ⧗:C̵,e,bt,end,full ⧗:k #9# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:C,e,bt,end,full ⧗:C̵,e,bt ○ ⧗:end,full ‹sapptok› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:e,bt,n,full ⧗:k #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:e,bt,n,full ⧗:e,bt ○ ⧗:n,full ‹sapptok› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:e,elem ⧗:k #11# ᛖ ⧗:b0 #10216# ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹sapp› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:e,elem ⧗:k #11# ᛖ ⧗:b0 #10216# ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:e,elem ⧗:e #10214# ‹scp› ⧗:e,elem ‹sapp› ⧗:e #10215# ‹scp› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹sappbase› ⸫

⍝ ‹canon› C i full: the type of type node i (full: with ⸮ ⁖ and the charge, for shapes)
⦃
  ⧖:C,i,full
  ⧗:C̵,i △ ‹nd› ‹tabs› ⧖:C,bt
  ⧗:C̵,i #3# ‹nd› ⧖:C,np
  ⧗:C̵,bt ‹tkd› ⧖:C,k
  ⍝ the element type and the charge first: strings are built one at a time
  ⧗:C̵,bt #8# ‹tf› ⧖:C,b0
  ⍝ 0: no element, 1: an array's element type, 2: a quotation type's signature (§9.5)
  ○ ⧗:k #11# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:k #11# ᛖ ⧗:b0 #10216# ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:ek
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:i #4# ⊞ ⧗:np ⊞ ⧗:full ⧗:ek ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ⦃ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹canon› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ‹qsigcanon› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,elem
  ⧗:C̵,bt ⧗:k #9# ᛖ ⧗:full △ ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹tokcharge› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ #16# ‹reg› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,ch
  ⧗:C̵ ‹sbeg› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:C̵,e,i,np,full ‹sapppfx›
  ⧗:e,bt,k,full,elem ‹sappbase›
  ⧗:ch #16# ‹tis› ⧖:C,neutral
  ⧗:C̵,e,ch ⧗:neutral ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:e,ch ⧗:e #8317# ‹scp› ⧗:e,ch ‹sapp› ⧗:e #8318# ‹scp› ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:e ‹send›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹canon› ⸫

⍝ ‹annot› C i: the evidential and charge written on type node i
⦃
  ⧖:C,i
  ⧗:C̵,i △ ‹nd› ‹tabs› ⧖:C,bt
  ⧗:C̵,i #3# ‹nd› ⧖:C,np
  ⧗:C̵,bt ‹tkd› ⧖:C,k
  ⍝ evidential: scan the prefix tokens and the type token
  ⧗:C̵,i,np,bt,k ‹tyev› ⧖:C,ev
  ⧗:C̵,bt ⧗:k #9# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹tokcharge› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ #16# ‹reg› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,ch
  ⧗:C̵,ev,ch
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹annot› ⸫

⍝ ‹tokev› C t ev: ev raised by the ⸮ (hearsay) or ⁖ (inferred) in token t's text
⦃
  ⧖:C,t,ev
  ⧗:C̵,t #7# ‹tf› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:t #8# ⊞ ⧗:t #8# ⊞ ⧗:n ⊞ ⧗:ev
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,j,end,ev
    ⧗:C̵,j,end,ev ⧗:j ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,j,end,ev ⧗:C̵,j ‹rd› ⧖:C,c ⧗:C̵ ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:end
        ⧗:ev ⧗:c #8278# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ △ ‹evmax› ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:c #11822# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ #2# ‹evmax› ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,j,end,ev ⧗:C̵,ev
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹tokev› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:C,i,np,bt,k
  ⧗:C̵,i ○ ○ ⧗:np
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,i,ev,j,np
    ⧗:C̵,i,ev,j,np ⧗:j ⧗:np ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,i,ev,j,np ⧗:C̵,i ⧗:j #4# ⊞ ‹nd› ‹tabs› ⧖:C,t ⧗:C̵,t,ev ‹tokev› ⧖:C,ev2 ⧗:C̵,i,ev2 ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:np ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,i,ev,j,np
  ⧗:C̵,bt,ev ⧗:k #9# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹tokev› ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:e ⌁ ⧗:e ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹tyev› ⸫

⍝ ---- values: [type id token region of role ev ch]; a moment has void in place of role

⍝ ‹vnew› C ty tok region: a new value with a fresh identity
⦃
  ⧖:C,ty,tok,region
  ⧗:C̵ ○ ‹inc› ⧖:C,id
  ⧗:C̵ #16# ‹reg› ⧖:C,ch
  ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:ty ⍆̵ ⧗:id △ ⊞ ⍆̵ ⧗:tok ⍆̵ ⧗:region ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ ⧗:ch ⍆̵ ⧗:v
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹vnew› ⸫
⍝ ‹vrec› C ty id tok region of x ev ch: a value (or moment) record
⦃
  ⧖:C,ty,id,tok,region,of,x,ev,ch
  ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:ty ⍆̵ ⧗:id ⍆̵ ⧗:tok ⍆̵ ⧗:region ⍆̵ ⧗:of ⍆̵ ⧗:x ⍆̵ ⧗:ev ⍆̵ ⧗:ch ⍆̵ ⧗:v
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹vrec› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,v,k ⧗:C̵ ⧗:v ⧗:k ⊞ ‹rd› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹vf› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,v,k,x ⧗:C̵ ⧗:v ⧗:k ⊞ ⧗:x ‹wr› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹vset› ⸫
⍝ ‹vall› C v: all eight fields
⦃
  ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,v ○ ‹vf› ⧖:C,a ⧗:C̵,v △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,b ⧗:C̵,v #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,c ⧗:C̵,v #3# ‹vf› ⧖:C,d
  ⧗:C̵,v #4# ‹vf› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵,v #5# ‹vf› ⧖:C,f ⧗:C̵,v #6# ‹vf› ⧖:C,g ⧗:C̵,v #7# ‹vf› ⧖:C,h
  ⧗:C̵,a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹vall› ⸫
⍝ ‹vrole› C v role: a copy of v with another role (s1's ck_with_role)
⦃ ⧖:C,v,role ⧗:C̵,v ‹vall› ⧖:C,a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h ⧗:C̵,a,b,c,d,e,role,g,h ‹vrec› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹vrole› ⸫
⍝ ‹vannot› C from to: copy ev and ch from one value to another
⦃
  ⧖:C,from,to
  ⧗:C̵,from #6# ‹vf› ⧖:C,ev ⧗:C̵,from #7# ‹vf› ⧖:C,ch
  ⧗:C̵,to #6# ⧗:ev ‹vset› ⧗:to #7# ⧗:ch ‹vset›
