⍝ ‹vty› C v
⦃ ○ ‹vf› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹vty› ⸫
⍝ ‹ltypes› C L: the list of the values' types
⦃
  ⧖:C,L
  ⧗:C̵,L ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,M
  ⧗:C̵,L,M ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,L,M,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,L,M,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,L,M,j,n ⧗:C̵,L,j ‹lget› ‹vty› ⧖:C,t ⧗:C̵,M,t ‹lpush› ⧖:C,M2 ⧗:C̵,L,M2 ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:M ⌁ ⧗:M
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹ltypes› ⸫

⍝ ---- functions: [name ins outs rev insEv insCh outsEv outsCh] (lists of types, evidentials, charges)

⍝ ‹sigtypes› C s full: the signature's input and output types (canonical) and annotations
⦃
  ⧖:C,s,full
  ⧗:C̵,s #3# ‹nd› ⧖:C,nin
  ⧗:C̵,s #2# ‹nd› ⧖:C,sz
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,e0
  ⍝ the loop carries [C c end k nin full ins outs iev ich oev och]
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:s #5# ⊞ ⧗:s ⧗:sz ⊞ ○ ⧗:nin,full,e0,e0,e0,e0,e0,e0
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,c,end,k,nin,full,ins,outs,iev,ich,oev,och
    ⧗:C̵,c,end,k,nin,full,ins,outs,iev,ich,oev,och ⧗:c ⧗:end ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹sigtype1› ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,c,end,k,nin,full,ins,outs,iev,ich,oev,och
  ⧗:C̵,ins,outs,iev,ich,oev,och
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹sigtypes› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:C,c,end,k,nin,full,ins,outs,iev,ich,oev,och
  ⧗:C̵,c,full ‹canon› ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C̵,c ‹annot› ⧖:C,ev,ch
  ⧗:C̵,c #2# ‹nd› ⧖:C,sz
  ⧗:k ⧗:nin ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⧖:isin
  ⧗:C̵,ins,t ⧗:isin ⋔ ⦃ ‹lpush› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,ins2
  ⧗:C̵,outs,t ⧗:isin ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹lpush› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,outs2
  ⧗:C̵,iev,ev ⧗:isin ⋔ ⦃ ‹lpush› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,iev2
  ⧗:C̵,ich,ch ⧗:isin ⋔ ⦃ ‹lpush› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,ich2
  ⧗:C̵,oev,ev ⧗:isin ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹lpush› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,oev2
  ⧗:C̵,och,ch ⧗:isin ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹lpush› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,och2
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:c ⧗:sz ⊞ ⧗:end ⧗:k △ ⊞ ⧗:nin,full,ins2,outs2,iev2,ich2,oev2,och2
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹sigtype1› ⸫

⍝ ‹fninfo› C s rev name: a function record [name ins outs rev iev ich oev och tvars item shape at
⍝ quotey qsigs rows rowin rowout];
⍝ tvars are the type variables of the inputs (§9.4); a generic function's item and shape, and an
⍝ instance's "ᚠ[ℤ], first called at …", are set later (−1 until then)
⦃
  ⧖:C,s,rev,name
  ⧗:C̵,s ○ ‹sigtypes› ⧖:C,ins,outs,iev,ich,oev,och
  ⧗:C̵,ins ‹tvars› ⧖:C,tv
  ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:name ⍆̵ ⧗:ins ⍆̵ ⧗:outs ⍆̵ ⧗:rev ⍆̵ ⧗:iev ⍆̵ ⧗:ich ⍆̵ ⧗:oev ⍆̵ ⧗:och ⍆̵ ⧗:tv ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ ⧗:f
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹fninfo› ⸫

⍝ ---- type variables (§9.4): a generic function is checked and emitted once per instance

⍝ ‹istvar› c: c is a type variable α … θ
⦃ #945# #952# ᛦ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹istvar› ⸫
⍝ ‹tvars› C ts: the type variables of the types ts, in order of first appearance
⦃
  ⧖:C,ts
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,vs
  ⧗:C̵,ts ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,ts,vs ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,ts,vs,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,ts,vs,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,ts,vs,j,n ⧗:C̵,ts,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,t ⧗:C̵,t,vs ‹tvars1› ⧖:C,vs2 ⧗:C̵,ts,vs2 ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,ts,vs,j,n ⧗:C̵,vs
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹tvars› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,t,vs
  ⧗:C̵,t ‹slen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,t,vs ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,t,vs,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,t,vs,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,t,vs,j,n ⧗:C̵,t,j ‹sat› ⧖:C,c ⧗:C̵,vs,c ‹lhas› ⧖:C,has
        ⧗:C̵,vs,c ⧗:c ‹istvar› ⧗:has ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹lpush› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,vs2
        ⧗:C̵,t,vs2 ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,t,vs,j,n ⧗:C̵,vs
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹tvars1› ⸫
⍝ ‹tbind› C ds xs: the bindings of the variables of the declared types ds to the classical types
⍝ they meet in the actual types xs (8 slots for α … θ, −1 while free); a declared ◌ may meet a
⍝ value that cannot fail
⦃ ⧖:C,ds,xs ⧗:C̵ ‹tbnew› ⧖:C,b ⧗:C̵,ds,xs,b ‹tbindinto› ⧗:b ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹tbind› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,ds,xs,b
  ⧗:C̵,ds ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,ds,xs,b ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,ds,xs,b,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,ds,xs,b,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,ds,xs,b,j,n ⧗:C̵,ds,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,d ⧗:C̵,xs,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,x ⧗:C̵,d,x,b ‹tbind1› ⧗:ds,xs,b ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹tbindinto› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,d,x,b
  ⧗:C̵,d ‹slen› ⧖:C,dn ⧗:C̵,x ‹slen› ⧖:C,xn
  ⍝ the loop carries [C d x b p q dn xn]
  ⧗:C̵,d,x,b ○ ○ ⧗:dn,xn
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,d,x,b,p,q,dn,xn
    ⧗:C̵,d,x,b,p,q,dn,xn ⧗:p ⧗:dn ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⧗:q ⧗:xn ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹tbind2› ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹tbind1› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,d,x,b,p,q,dn,xn
  ⧗:C̵,d,p ‹sat› ⧖:C,dc ⧗:C̵,x,q ‹sat› ⧖:C,xc
  ⍝ 1: a variable meets a type, 2: the same code point, 3: a declared ◌ alone, 4: a mismatch
  #4# ⧗:dc #9676# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #3# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:dc ⧗:xc ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:dc ‹istvar› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:k
  ⧗:C̵,b,dc,xc ⧗:k △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹tbind3› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,d,x,b
  ⧗:p,q,dn,k ⍿⁰ #3# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:pp,qq,nn ⧗:pp △ ⊞ ⧗:qq ⦄ ⦃ #4# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:pp,qq,nn ⧗:nn ⧗:qq ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:pp,qq,nn ⧗:pp △ ⊞ ⧗:qq △ ⊞ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:dn,xn
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹tbind2› ⸫
⍝ ‹tbind3› C b v t: bind variable v to the code point t, if t is a classical base type and v is free
⦃
  ⧖:C,b,v,t
  ⧗:C̵,b ⧗:v #945# ⊟ ‹lget› ⧖:C,old
  ⧗:t #8484# ᛖ ⧗:t #8477# ᛖ ⋏ ⧗:t #359# ᛖ ⋏ ⧗:t #120121# ᛖ ⋏ ⧗:old #-1# ᛖ ⋎ ⧖:ok
  ⧗:C̵,b,v,t ⧗:ok ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:C,b,v,t ⧗:C̵,b ⧗:v #945# ⊟ ⧗:t ‹lset› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹tbind3› ⸫
⍝ ‹tsubst› C t b: type t with its bound variables replaced (interned)
⦃
  ⧖:C,t,b
  ⧗:C̵ ‹sbeg› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:C̵,t ‹slen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,e,t,b ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,e,t,b,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,e,t,b,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,e,t,b,j,n ⧗:C̵,t,j ‹sat› ⧖:C,c
        ⧗:C̵,b,c ⧗:c ‹istvar› ⋔ ⦃ ‹tsubc› ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:C,bb,cc ⧗:C̵,cc ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,c2
        ⧗:C̵,e,c2 ‹scp› ⧗:e,t,b ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,e,t,b,j,n ⧗:C̵,e ‹send›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹tsubst› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,b,c
  ⧗:C̵,b ⧗:c #945# ⊟ ‹lget› ⧖:C,w
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:c ⧗:w ⧗:w #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:ww ⌁ ⧗:ww ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹tsubc› ⸫
⍝ ‹tsubstl› C ts b: ‹tsubst› over a list
⦃
  ⧖:C,ts,b
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,out
  ⧗:C̵,ts ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,ts,b,out ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,ts,b,out,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,ts,b,out,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,ts,b,out,j,n ⧗:C̵,ts,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,t ⧗:C̵,t,b ‹tsubst› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵,out,s ‹lpush› ⧖:C,out2 ⧗:C̵,ts,b,out2 ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,ts,b,out,j,n ⧗:C̵,out
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹tsubstl› ⸫
⍝ ‹toptys› C S k: the types of the top k values of S (values, emit entries and evaluated values
⍝ all keep their type in field 0)
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,k
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,out
  ⧗:C̵,S ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,S,out ⧗:n ⧗:k ⊟ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,S,out,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,S,out,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,S,out,j,n ⧗:C̵,S,j ‹lget› ○ ‹vf› ⧖:C,t ⧗:C̵,out,t ‹lpush› ⧖:C,out2 ⧗:C̵,S,out2 ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,S,out,j,n ⧗:C̵,out
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹toptys› ⸫
⍝ ‹instrec› C f b at: the record of generic f's instance for bindings b, named ᚠ[ℤ …]
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,b,at
  ⧗:C̵,f ‹rd› ⧖:C,name
  ⧗:C̵,f #8# ‹vf› ⧖:C,vs
  ⧗:C̵,vs ‹llen› ⧖:C,nv
  ⧗:C̵ ‹sbeg› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:C̵,e,name ‹sapp› ⧗:e #91# ‹scp›
  ⧗:e,vs,b ○ ⧗:nv
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,e,vs,b,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,e,vs,b,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,e,vs,b,j,n ⧗:C̵,e ⧗:j ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:ee ⧗:ee #32# ‹scp› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄
        ⧗:vs,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,v ⧗:C̵,b ⧗:v #945# ⊟ ‹lget› ⧖:C,t ⧗:C̵,e,t ‹scp›
        ⧗:e,vs,b ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,e,vs,b,j,n ⧗:C̵,e #93# ‹scp› ⧗:e ‹send› ⧖:C,key
  ⧗:C̵,f △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,ins ⧗:C̵,ins,b ‹tsubstl› ⧖:C,gi
  ⧗:C̵,f #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,outs ⧗:C̵,outs,b ‹tsubstl› ⧖:C,go
  ⧗:C̵,f #10# ‹vf› ⧖:C,shp ⧗:C̵,shp,b ‹tsubst› ⧖:C,gshp
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,none
  ⧗:C̵,f #4# ‹vf› ⧖:C,iev ⧗:C̵,f #5# ‹vf› ⧖:C,ich ⧗:C̵,f #6# ‹vf› ⧖:C,oev ⧗:C̵,f #7# ‹vf› ⧖:C,och
  ⧗:C̵,f #9# ‹vf› ⧖:C,it
  ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,g
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:key ⍆̵ ⧗:gi ⍆̵ ⧗:go ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ ⧗:iev ⍆̵ ⧗:ich ⍆̵ ⧗:oev ⍆̵ ⧗:och ⍆̵ ⧗:none ⍆̵ ⧗:it ⍆̵ ⧗:gshp ⍆̵ ⧗:at ⍆̵ ○ ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ #-1# ⍆̵ ⧗:g
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹instrec› ⸫
⍝ ‹isgeneric› C f: f has type variables, quotation parameters or rows
⦃ ⧖:C,f ⧗:C̵,f #8# ‹vf› ⧖:C,tv ⧗:C̵,tv ‹llen› ⧖:C,n ⧗:C̵,f #12# ‹vf› ⧖:C,qy ⧗:C̵ ⧗:n ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⧗:qy △ ᛖ ⋏ ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹isgeneric› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,tok,xs,v
  ⧗:C̵,f ‹rd› ⧖:C,name
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› $cannot infer $ ⎙̵ ⧗:v ᚢ $ for $ ⎙̵ ⧗:name ‹spr› $ from $ ⎙̵ ⧗:xs ○ ‹plist›
  $: a type variable stands for a classical type ℤ ℝ ŧ 𝔹 (§9.4)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹noinfer› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,tok,v
  ⧗:C̵,f ‹rd› ⧖:C,name
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› ⧗:v ᚢ $ appears only in the outputs of $ ⎙̵ ⧗:name ‹spr› $; every type variable must be fixed by an input (§9.4)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹outvar› ⸫

⍝ ---- quotations (§9.5): a block as a value, typed ⦃line:col⦄ by where it is written; ⍎ runs
⍝ its body where it is applied. Register 58 maps quotation types to their nodes; 59 records
⍝ which instance a call makes, as seen from the function being checked (register 55).

⍝ ‹qtype› C tok: the type of the quotation whose ⦃ is token tok
⍝ (in a module of planes, by the lattice coordinates of its ⦃, which are unique: ⦃x,y,z⦄)
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok
  ⧗:C̵,tok △ ‹tf› ⧖:C,l ⧗:C̵,tok #2# ‹tf› ⧖:C,c
  ⧗:C̵,l,c ⧗:l ‹isplane› ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:C,l,c ⧗:l ‹plx1› △ ⊟ ⧖:x ⧗:l ‹ply› ⧖:y ⧗:l ‹plz› ⧖:z ⧗:C̵ %%!⦃{#x},{#y},{#z}⦄%% ⦄
    ⦃ ⧖:C,l,c ⧗:C̵ %%!⦃{#l}:{#c}⦄%% ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹qtype› ⸫
⍝ ‹pair› C a b: the list [a b]
⦃ ⧖:C,a,b ⧗:C̵ ‹lbeg› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵,e,a ‹ladd› ⧗:e,b ‹ladd› ⧗:e ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹pair› ⸫
⍝ ‹regpush› C r v: append v to the list in register r
⦃ ⧖:C,r,v ⧗:C̵,r ‹reg› ⧖:C,L ⧗:C̵,L,v ‹lpush› ⧖:C,L2 ⧗:C̵,r,L2 ‹wr› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹regpush› ⸫
⍝ ‹qset› C qt node: remember the quotation's node
⦃ ⧖:C,qt,node ⧗:C̵,qt,node ‹pair› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵ #58# ⧗:e ‹regpush› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹qset› ⸫
⍝ ‹qget› C qt: the node of quotation type qt (the latest remembered)
⦃
  ⧖:C,qt
  ⧗:C̵ #58# ‹reg› ⧖:C,L
  ⧗:C̵,L ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,L,qt ○ ⧗:n #-1#
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,L,qt,j,n,found
    ⧗:C̵,L,qt,j,n,found ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,L,qt,j,n,found ⧗:C̵,L,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵,e ○ ‹lget› ⧖:C,ek ⧗:C̵,e △ ‹lget› ⧖:C,en
        ⧗:C̵,L,qt ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⧗:found ⧗:en ⧗:ek ⧗:qt ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,L,qt,j,n,found ⧗:C̵,found
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹qget› ⸫
⍝ ‹isattest› C op to: is quoted block op the predicate of a ⊨ right after it?
⦃
  ⧖:C,op,to
  ⧗:C̵,op #2# ‹nd› ⧖:C,sz
  ⧗:op ⧗:sz ⊞ ⧖:nx
  ⧗:C̵,nx,to ⧗:nx ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹isattest1› ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹isattest› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,nx,to
  ⧗:C̵,nx ○ ‹nd› ⧖:C,nk ⧗:C̵,nx ‹ndt› ⧖:C,atok
  ⧗:C̵,atok #8# #8872# ‹tis1› ⧖:C,isat
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:nk #5# ᛖ ⧗:isat ⋎
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹isattest1› ⸫
⍝ ‹isrow› c: ρ or σ
⦃ ⧖:c ⧗:c #961# ᛖ ⧗:c #963# ᛖ ⋏ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ŧ⟩ ‹isrow› ⸫
⍝ ‹rowslot› c: ρ 0, σ 1
⦃ ⧖:c ○ ⧗:c #963# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⦄ ⟨ℤ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹rowslot› ⸫
⍝ ‹rowof› C t: the row variable type t is (its code point), or −1
⦃
  ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C̵,t ‹slen› ⧖:C,n ⧗:C̵,t ‹shead› ⧖:C,h
  ⧗:C̵ #-1# ⧗:h ⧗:n △ ᛖ ⧗:h ‹isrow› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:hh ⌁ ⧗:hh ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹rowof› ⸫
⍝ ‹rowhead› C ts: the row variable heading a list of types, or −1
⦃
  ⧖:C,ts
  ⧗:C̵,ts ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,ts ⧗:n ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #-1# ⦄ ⦃ ○ ‹lget› ‹rowof› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹rowhead› ⸫
⍝ ‹rowtail› C ts: ts without its heading row variable, if it has one
⦃
  ⧖:C,ts
  ⧗:C̵,ts ‹rowhead› ⧖:C,r ⧗:C̵,ts ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,ts,n ⧗:r #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:L,m ⧗:L △ ⧗:m ‹lslice› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹rowtail› ⸫
⍝ ‹effstr› C a b: "⟨a ⊸ b⟩", the types joined by spaces
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,b
  ⧗:C̵ ‹sbeg› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:C̵,e #10216# ‹scp› ⧗:e,a ‹sappj› ⧗:e #32# ‹scp› ⧗:e #8888# ‹scp› ⧗:e #32# ‹scp› ⧗:e,b ‹sappj› ⧗:e #10217# ‹scp› ⧗:e ‹send›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹effstr› ⸫
⍝ ‹qsigcanon› C s: the type of a quotation type with signature node s, as written: ⟨a ⊸ b⟩
⦃
  ⧖:C,s
  ⧗:C̵,s △ ‹sigtypes› ⧖:C,ins,outs,a,b,c,d
  ⧗:C̵,ins ‹llen› ⧖:C,ni ⧗:C̵,outs ‹llen› ⧖:C,no
  ⧗:C̵ ‹sbeg› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:C̵,e #10216# ‹scp› ⧗:e,ins ‹sappj›
  ⧗:e ⧗:ni ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ #32# ‹scp› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄
  ⧗:e #8888# ‹scp›
  ⧗:e ⧗:no ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ #32# ‹scp› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄
  ⧗:e,outs ‹sappj› ⧗:e #10217# ‹scp› ⧗:e ‹send›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹qsigcanon› ⸫
⍝ ‹qeffect› C x T tok: the effect of quotation x run on the values T: the types of the part of T
⍝ it takes and of what it leaves. Untouched values keep their ids: they are the common prefix.
⦃
  ⧖:C,x,T,tok
  ⧗:C̵,x ‹qget› ⧖:C,qn
  ⧗:C̵ △ ‹reg› ⧖:C,tr ⧗:C̵ △ ○ ‹wr› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ #60# ‹reg› ⧖:C,vw0 ⧗:C̵ #60# ○ ‹wr› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:qn #3# ⊞ ⧗:T △ ⧗:e ○ ‹subb› ⧖:C,R,rst,rdead
  ⧗:C̵ #60# ⧗:vw0 ‹wr› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ △ ⧗:tr ‹wr› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,T ‹llen› ⧖:C,nt ⧗:C̵,R ‹llen› ⧖:C,nr
  ⧗:C̵,T,R,nt,nr ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,T,R,nt,nr,p
    ⧗:C̵,T,R,nt,nr,p ⧗:p ⧗:nt ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⧗:p ⧗:nr ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹qprefix1› ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,T,R,nt,nr,p
  ⧗:C̵,T ⧗:nt ⧗:p ⊟ ‹toptys› ⧖:C,a
  ⧗:C̵,R ⧗:nr ⧗:p ⊟ ‹toptys› ⧖:C,o
  ⧗:C̵,a,o
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹qeffect› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,T,R,nt,nr,p
  ⧗:C̵,T,p ‹lget› △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,a ⧗:C̵,R,p ‹lget› △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,b
  ⧗:C̵,T,R,nt,nr,p ⧗:a ⧗:b ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ △ ⊞ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ⟩ ‹qprefix1› ⸫
⍝ ‹qbad› C tok x have nm want: the quotation does not have the effect the parameter names
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,x,have,nm,want
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› $the quotation $ ⎙̵ ⧗:x ‹spr› $ has effect $ ⎙̵ ⧗:have ‹spr› $, but $ ⎙̵ ⧗:nm ‹spr›
  $ wants $ ⎙̵ ⧗:want ‹spr› $ (§9.5)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹qbad› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,tok,x,have,nm,want,bad ⧗:C̵,tok,x,have,nm,want ⧗:bad ⋔ ⦃ ‹qbad› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹qbadif› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,want,nm
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› $cannot infer the types $ ⎙̵ ⧗:want ‹spr› $ of $ ⎙̵ ⧗:nm ‹spr› $'s quotation: no other argument fixes them (§9.5)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹qnoinfer› ⸫
⍝ ‹qwiden› C T ai ao n: widen the effect ⟨ai ⊸ ao⟩ to take all n fixed inputs on top of T
⦃
  ⧖:C,T,ai,ao,n
  ⧗:C̵,ai ‹llen› ⧖:C,na ⧗:C̵,T ‹llen› ⧖:C,nt
  ⧗:C̵,T,ai,ao ⧗:nt ⧗:n ⊟ ⧗:nt ⧗:na ⊟ ⧗:na ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ‹qkeep› ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹qpad› ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹qwiden› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,T,ai,ao,t0,t1 ⧗:C̵,ai,ao ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹qkeep› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,T,ai,ao,t0,t1
  ⧗:C̵,T,t0,t1 ‹lslice› ⧖:C,ps ⧗:C̵,ps ‹ltypes› ⧖:C,pad
  ⧗:C̵,pad,ai ‹lcat› ⧖:C,ai2 ⧗:C̵,pad,ao ‹lcat› ⧖:C,ao2
  ⧗:C̵,ai2,ao2
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹qpad› ⸫
⍝ ‹qmatch› C nm x qs below b rb tok: match quotation x against parameter effect qs = [ins outs]
⍝ of function nm: run x on the values below and fresh values of the fixed inputs, then bind the
⍝ row (rb: ρ and σ) and the type variables (b)
⦃
  ⧖:C,nm,x,qs,below,b,rb,tok
  ⧗:C̵,qs ○ ‹lget› ⧖:C,pi0 ⧗:C̵,qs △ ‹lget› ⧖:C,po0
  ⧗:C̵,pi0,po0 ‹effstr› ⧖:C,want
  ⧗:C̵,pi0 ‹rowhead› ⧖:C,prow
  ⧗:C̵,pi0 ‹rowtail› ⧖:C,pi ⧗:C̵,po0 ‹rowtail› ⧖:C,po
  ⧗:C̵,pi ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,pi,b,below,nm,want,tok ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,pi,b,T,nm,want,tok,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,pi,b,T,nm,want,tok,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,pi,b,T,nm,want,tok,j,n ⧗:C̵,pi,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,t0 ⧗:C̵,t0,b ‹tsubst› ⧖:C,t
        ⧗:C̵,t ‹l1› ⧖:C,tl ⧗:C̵,tl ‹tvars› ⧖:C,tv ⧗:C̵,tv ‹llen› ⧖:C,nv
        ⧗:C̵,tok,want,nm ⧗:nv ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹qnoinfer› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⧖:C
        ⧗:C̵,t,tok △ ‹vnew› ⧖:C,v ⧗:C̵,T,v ‹lpush› ⧖:C,T2
        ⧗:C̵,pi,b,T2,nm,want,tok ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,pi,b,T,nm,want,tok,j,n
  ⧗:C̵,x,T,tok ‹qeffect› ⧖:C,ai0,ao0
  ⧗:C̵,T,ai0,ao0,n ‹qwiden› ⧖:C,ai,ao
  ⧗:C̵,ai,ao ‹effstr› ⧖:C,have
  ⧗:C̵,ai ‹llen› ⧖:C,na ⧗:C̵,ao ‹llen› ⧖:C,no
  ⧗:na ⧗:n ⊟ ⧖:rn
  ⍝ it takes values from below its inputs without a row to take them from, or leaves too few
  ⧗:C̵,tok,x,have,nm,want ⧗:rn ○ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⧗:prow #-1# ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:no ⧗:rn ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⋏ ‹qbadif› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,ai ○ ⧗:rn ‹lslice› ⧖:C,row
  ⧗:C̵,ao ○ ⧗:rn ‹lslice› ⧖:C,row2
  ⧗:C̵,ao,rn,no ‹lslice› ⧖:C,bq
  ⧗:C̵,bq ‹llen› ⧖:C,nbq ⧗:C̵,po ‹llen› ⧖:C,npo
  ⧗:C̵,row,row2 ‹leq› ⧖:C,same
  ⧗:C̵,tok,x,have,nm,want ⧗:same ‹not› ⧗:nbq ⧗:npo ᛖ ‹not› ⋏ ‹qbadif› ⧖:C
  ⍝ the outputs fix more variables, and must then agree
  ⧗:C̵,po,bq,b ‹tbindinto› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,po,b ‹tsubstl› ⧖:C,pob ⧗:C̵,pob,bq ‹leq› ⧖:C,same2
  ⧗:C̵,tok,x,have,nm,want ⧗:same2 ‹not› ‹qbadif› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,rb,row,prow,tok,x,have,nm,want ⧗:prow #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹qrow› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹qmatch› ⸫
