  ⧗:C̵,rb,slot ‹lget› ⧖:C,old
  ⧗:C̵,rb,slot,row,old,tok,x,have,nm,want ⧗:old #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹qrowset› ⦄ ⦃ ‹qrowsame› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹qrow› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,rb,slot,row,old,tok,x,have,nm,want ⧗:C̵,rb,slot,row ‹lset› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹qrowset› ⸫
⦃
