  ⧗:C̵,tok,qt ⧗:qh #10627# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹notquote› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,qt ‹qget› ⧖:C,qn
