  ⧗:C̵ #60# ‹reg› ⧖:C,vw0 ⧗:C̵ #60# ○ ‹wr› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:qn #3# ⊞ ⧗:S2,depth,inner ⧗:ind △ ⊞ ‹subb› ⧖:C,S3,qst,qdead
  ⧗:C̵ #60# ⧗:vw0 ‹wr› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,qst ○ ‹noleak› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,S3,strand,qdead ○ #11# ⧗:qt
