  ⧗:C̵,ind,S,lab,larg ⧗:on ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:C,ind,S,lab,larg ⧗:ind ‹pind› ⧗:lab #11# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ $⍎ $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:C̵,larg ‹spr› ⧗:S ‹trtail› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
