⍝ ‹cgeneric› C f i tok rev ffi sig: mark f generic if its signature has type variables,
⍝ quotation parameters or row variables, and check where they may appear (§9.4, §9.5)
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,i,tok,rev,ffi,sig
  ⧗:C̵,f △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,ins ⧗:C̵,f #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,outs
  ⧗:C̵,f #8# ‹vf› ⧖:C,tv ⧗:C̵,outs ‹tvars› ⧖:C,tvo
  ⍝ the quotation parameters: [ins outs] per input (−1 for the others), and their rows
  ⧗:C̵,sig,tok ‹qsigsof› ⧖:C,qsigs,rows,qy0
  ⧗:C̵,ins ‹rowhead› ⧖:C,rowin ⧗:C̵,outs ‹rowhead› ⧖:C,rowout
  ⧗:qy0 ⧗:rowin #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⋏ ⧗:rowout #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⋏ ⧖:qy
  ⧗:C̵,tv ‹llen› ⧖:C,nv ⧗:C̵,tvo ‹llen› ⧖:C,nvo
  ⧗:C̵,f,i,tok,rev,ffi,sig,tv,tvo,qsigs,rows,rowin,rowout,qy ⧗:nv ○ ᛖ ⧗:nvo ○ ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:qy ‹not› ⋎
  ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹cgeneric1› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ ŧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cgeneric› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,i,tok,rev,ffi,sig,tv,tvo,qsigs,rows,rowin,rowout,qy
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:ffi ‹not› ⧗:tok #26# ‹cfailunless› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:rev ‹not› ⧗:tok #27# ‹cfailunless› ⧖:C
  ⍝ a row variable stands for the bottom of an effect, so it comes first
  ⧗:C̵,f △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,ins ⧗:C̵,ins,tok ‹rowsfirst› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,f #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,outs ⧗:C̵,outs,tok ‹rowsfirst› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,qsigs,tok ‹rowsfirstq› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,rows,rowin ‹lhas› ⧖:C,hasin
  ⧗:C̵,rows,rowin ⧗:rowin #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⧗:hasin ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹lpush› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,rows2
  ⧗:C̵,rows2,rowout ‹lhas› ⧖:C,hasout
  ⧗:C̵,f,tok,rowout ⧗:rowout #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⧗:hasout ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹outrow› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⍝ every variable of the outputs must be fixed by an input
  ⧗:C̵,tvo ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,f,tok,tv,tvo ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,f,tok,tv,tvo,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,f,tok,tv,tvo,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,f,tok,tv,tvo,j,n ⧗:C̵,tvo,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,v ⧗:C̵,tv,v ‹lhas› ⧖:C,has
        ⧗:C̵,f,tok,v ⧗:has ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹outvar› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
        ⧗:C̵,f,tok,tv,tvo ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,f,tok,tv,tvo,j,n
  ⧗:C̵,sig ‹cshape› ⧖:C,shp
  ⧗:C̵,f #9# ⧗:i ‹vset› ⧗:f #10# ⧗:shp ‹vset› ⧖:C
  ○ ⧗:qy ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:qyn
  ⧗:C̵,f #12# ⧗:qyn ‹vset› ⧗:f #13# ⧗:qsigs ‹vset› ⧗:f #14# ⧗:rows2 ‹vset› ⧗:f #15# ⧗:rowin ‹vset› ⧗:f #16# ⧗:rowout ‹vset›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ ŧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cgeneric1› ⸫
⍝ ‹qsigsof› C sig tok: for each input of signature node sig, its quotation type's [ins outs] or −1;
⍝ the rows of the quotation types; whether there are any
⦃
  ⧖:C,sig,tok
  ⧗:C̵,sig #3# ‹nd› ⧖:C,nin
  ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,qs ⧗:C̵ ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,rows
  ⍝ the loop carries [C c tok qs rows qy j nin]
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:sig #5# ⊞ ⧗:tok,qs,rows ⊕ ○ ⧗:nin
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,c,tok,qs,rows,qy,j,nin
    ⧗:C̵,c,tok,qs,rows,qy,j,nin ⧗:j ⧗:nin ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹qsigs1› ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,c,tok,qs,rows,qy,j,nin ⧗:C̵,qs,rows,qy
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ŧ⟩ ‹qsigsof› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,c,tok,qs,rows,qy,j,nin
  ⧗:C̵,c △ ‹nd› ‹tabs› ⧖:C,bt
  ⧗:C̵,bt #11# #10216# ‹tis1› ⧖:C,isq
  ⧗:C̵,c,tok,qs,rows,qy ⧗:isq ⋔ ⦃ ‹qsigs2› ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:C,cc,tk,q,r,y ⧗:C̵,q #-1# ‹lpush› ⧖:C,q2 ⧗:C̵,q2,r,y ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,qs2,rows2,qy2
  ⧗:C̵,c #2# ‹nd› ⧖:C,sz
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:c ⧗:sz ⊞ ⧗:tok,qs2,rows2,qy2 ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:nin
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹qsigs1› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,c,tok,qs,rows,qy
  ⧗:C̵,c #3# ‹nd› ⧖:C,np
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:c #4# ⊞ ⧗:np ⊞ ○ ‹sigtypes› ⧖:C,qi,qo,a,b,d,e
  ⧗:C̵,qi,qo ‹pair› ⧖:C,qe
  ⧗:C̵,qs,qe ‹lpush› ⧖:C,qs2
  ⍝ a quotation type keeps its row on both sides
  ⧗:C̵,qi ‹rowhead› ⧖:C,r1 ⧗:C̵,qo ‹rowhead› ⧖:C,r2
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:r1 ⧗:r2 ᛖ ⧗:tok #28# ‹cfailunless› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,rows,r1 ‹lhas› ⧖:C,has
  ⧗:C̵,rows,r1 ⧗:r1 #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⧗:has ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹lpush› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,rows2
  ⧗:C̵,qs2,rows2 ⦶
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ŧ⟩ ‹qsigs2› ⸫
⍝ ‹rowsfirst› C ts tok: no row variable after the first type
⦃
  ⧖:C,ts,tok
  ⧗:C̵,ts ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,ts,tok △ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,ts,tok,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,ts,tok,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄
      ⦃ ⧖:C,ts,tok,j,n ⧗:C̵,ts,j ‹lget› ‹rowof› ⧖:C,r ⧗:C̵ ⧗:r #-1# ᛖ ⧗:tok #29# ‹cfailunless› ⧖:C ⧗:C̵,ts,tok ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹rowsfirst› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,qs,tok
  ⧗:C̵,qs ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,qs,tok ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,qs,tok,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,qs,tok,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,qs,tok,j,n ⧗:C̵,qs,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,e
        ⧗:C̵,e,tok ⧗:e #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹rowsfirste› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
        ⧗:C̵,qs,tok ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹rowsfirstq› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,e,tok ⧗:C̵,e ○ ‹lget› ⧖:C,a ⧗:C̵,a,tok ‹rowsfirst› ⧗:e △ ‹lget› ⧖:C,b ⧗:C̵,b,tok ‹rowsfirst› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹rowsfirste› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,tok,v
  ⧗:C̵,f ‹rd› ⧖:C,name
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› ⧗:v ᚢ $ appears only in the outputs of $ ⎙̵ ⧗:name ‹spr› $; every row variable must be fixed by an input (§9.5)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
