⍝ ‹tbnew› C: 8 free slots for α … θ
⦃ ⧖:C ⧗:C̵ ‹lbeg› ⧖:C,b ⧗:C̵,b #-1# ‹ladd› ⧗:b #-1# ‹ladd› ⧗:b #-1# ‹ladd› ⧗:b #-1# ‹ladd› ⧗:b #-1# ‹ladd› ⧗:b #-1# ‹ladd› ⧗:b #-1# ‹ladd› ⧗:b #-1# ‹ladd› ⧗:b ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹tbnew› ⸫
⍝ ‹cinstance› C f S tok: a call of generic f on the values on top of S: the instance's record,
⍝ made and queued for checking (register 57) the first time. Plain arguments fix the type
⍝ variables; each quotation argument's effect fixes its row variable (§9.4, §9.5)
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,S,tok
  ⧗:C̵,f △ ‹vf› ‹rowtail› ⧖:C,fixed
  ⧗:C̵,fixed ‹llen› ⧖:C,k ⧗:C̵,S ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
