  ⧗:b ⧗:q ⧗:sp ⋏ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ $, $ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:b ⋔ ⦃ $◌̱ borrowed$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
  $ (§6.1)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
