⍝ ---- charges

⍝ ‹chsame› C a b: the common charge of a and b (a gluon takes the other), or −1
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,b
  ⧗:C̵,a #17# ‹tis› ⧖:C,ga ⧗:C̵,b #17# ‹tis› ⧖:C,gb
  ⧗:C̵ #-1# ⧗:a ⧗:a ⧗:b ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧗:a ⧗:gb ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧗:b ⧗:ga ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹chsame› ⸫

⍝ ‹chcomb› C a b sign: product (sign 1) or quotient (sign −1) of charges; gluons count as neutral
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,b,sign
  ⧗:C̵,a #17# ‹tis› ⧖:C,ga ⧗:C̵,b #17# ‹tis› ⧖:C,gb
  ⧗:C̵,a,b,sign ⧗:ga ⧗:gb ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ #17# ‹reg› ⦄ ⦃ ‹chcomb1› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹chcomb› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,a,b,sign
  ⧗:C̵,a ‹chvec› ⧖:C,a1,a2,a3,a4,a5,a6
  ⧗:C̵,b ‹chvec› ⧖:C,b1,b2,b3,b4,b5,b6
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:a1 ⧗:b1 ⧗:sign ⊠ ⊞ ⧗:a2 ⧗:b2 ⧗:sign ⊠ ⊞ ⧗:a3 ⧗:b3 ⧗:sign ⊠ ⊞
  ⧗:a4 ⧗:b4 ⧗:sign ⊠ ⊞ ⧗:a5 ⧗:b5 ⧗:sign ⊠ ⊞ ⧗:a6 ⧗:b6 ⧗:sign ⊠ ⊞ ‹chfmt›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹chcomb1› ⸫

⍝ ---- glyph operators: ‹glyph› C op S strand depth locks → C S strand

⍝ ⧖: bind the top of the stack as a moment
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,S,strand,depth,locks
  ⧗:C̵,S △ ⧗:tok ○ ‹pop› ⧖:C,S2,vals
  ⧗:C̵,vals ○ ‹lget› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,v ‹vall› ⧖:C,ty,id,vtok,rg,of,role,ev,ch
  ⧗:C̵,ty,id,tok,rg,of ○ ⧗:ev,ch ‹vrec› ⧖:C,m
  ⧗:C̵,strand,m ‹lpush› ⧖:C,strand2
  ⧗:C̵,S2,strand2
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹g_bind› ⸫

⍝ ⧗ⁿ: read a moment, of this block or (past its strand) of an enclosing one
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,S,strand,depth,locks
  ⧗:C̵,tok #4# ‹tf› ⧖:C,idx
  ⧗:C̵,strand ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,tok,S,strand,depth,locks,idx,n ⧗:idx ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ‹g_rdouter› ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹g_rdlocal› ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹g_read› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,S,strand,depth,locks,idx,n
  ⧗:n △ ⊟ ⧗:idx ⊟ ⧖:mi
  ⧗:C̵,strand,mi ‹lget› ⧖:C,m
  ⧗:C̵,m ‹vall› ⧖:C,ty,id,mtok,rg,of,void,ev,ch
  ⧗:C̵,tok,ty,mtok ⧗:void △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹voiderr› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⍝ a read agrees with the class of the moment's value, like an operator (§6.1)
  ⧗:C̵,m ‹l1› ⧖:C,vs ⧗:C̵,tok,vs ‹agree› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,ty ‹tcopy› ⧖:C,cp
  ⧗:C̵,tok,depth,strand,mi,m ⧗:cp ⋔ ⦃ ‹rd_copy› ⦄ ⦃ ‹rd_move› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,v,strand2
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹trole› ⧖:C,role
  ⧗:C̵,v,role ⧗:role #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹vrole› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,v2
  ⧗:C̵,S,v2 ‹lpush› ⧖:C,S2
  ⧗:C̵,S2,strand2
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹g_rdlocal› ⸫

⍝ ⧗ⁿ past this block's strand reads a moment of an enclosing block (§5.1). Only
⍝ borrowed moments are visible there: a ⟗ is copied, and a ⟖ is lent as a fresh ⟖
⍝ that cannot leave this block, while the moment itself stays bound (s1's
⍝ ck_read_outer). The views of the enclosing blocks are a chain from register 60.
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,S,strand,depth,locks,idx,n
  ⧗:C̵ #60# ‹reg› ⧖:C,vw
  ⧗:C̵,vw △ ‹lget› ⧖:C,pv
  ⍝ the loop carries [C view j total m]
  ⧗:C̵,pv ⧗:idx ⧗:n ⊟ ⧗:n #-1#
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,v,j,total,m
    ⧗:C̵,v,j,total,m ⧗:v ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ‹rdo_step› ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,v,j,total,m
  ⧗:C̵,tok,idx,total ⧗:m #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹readerr› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,m ‹vall› ⧖:C,ty,id,mtok,rg,of,void,ev,ch
  ⧗:C̵,ty ‹tclass› ⧖:C,cl
  ⧗:C̵,tok,ty ⧗:cl △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹outerr› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,tok,ty,mtok ⧗:void △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹voiderr› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,m ‹l1› ⧖:C,vs ⧗:C̵,tok,vs ‹agree› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,ty ‹shead› ⧖:C,h
  ⧗:C̵,tok,S,strand,pv,of,ty,depth,rg ⧗:h #10198# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹rdo_lend› ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:C,tok,S,strand,pv,of,ty,depth,rg ⧗:C̵,ty,tok,rg ‹vnew› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,v #4# ⧗:of ‹vset› ⧗:m,v ‹vannot› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹trole› ⧖:C,role
  ⧗:C̵,v,role ⧗:role #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹vrole› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,v2
  ⧗:C̵,S,v2 ‹lpush› ⧗:strand
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹g_rdouter› ⸫
⍝ ‹rdo_step› C view j total m: look in one enclosing view; a found moment ends the walk
⦃
  ⧖:C,v,j,total,m
  ⧗:C̵,v ○ ‹lget› ⧖:C,st
  ⧗:C̵,st ‹llen› ⧖:C,sl
  ⧗:C̵,v △ ‹lget› ⧖:C,pv
  ⧗:C̵,st,sl,j,total,pv ⧗:j ⧗:sl ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ‹rdo_skip› ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹rdo_take› ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹rdo_step› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,st,sl,j,total,pv ⧗:C̵,pv ⧗:j ⧗:sl ⊟ ⧗:total ⧗:sl ⊞ #-1# ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹rdo_skip› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,st,sl,j,total,pv
  ⧗:C̵,st ⧗:sl △ ⊟ ⧗:j ⊟ ‹lget› ⧖:C,m
  ⧗:C̵ ○ ⧗:j ⧗:total ⧗:sl ⊞ ⧗:m
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹rdo_take› ⸫
⍝ ‹rdo_lend› C tok S strand view of ty depth rg: a fresh ⟖, if it would be the only live one
⍝ besides the moment (on the stack, in this strand, or in any enclosing one)
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,S,strand,pv,of,ty,depth,rg
  ⧗:C̵,S,of ○ ‹cntex› ⧖:C,a
  ⧗:C̵,strand,of △ ‹cntex› ⧖:C,b
  ⧗:C̵,pv,of ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,v,of,k
    ⧗:C̵,v,of,k ⧗:v ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄
      ⦃ ⧖:C,v,of,k ⧗:C̵,v ○ ‹lget› ⧖:C,st ⧗:C̵,st,of △ ‹cntex› ⧖:C,c ⧗:C̵,v △ ‹lget› ⧖:C,nv ⧗:C̵,nv,of ⧗:k ⧗:c ⊞ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,v,of,k
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:a ⧗:b ⊞ ⧗:k ⊞ △ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⧗:tok #9# ‹cfailunless› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,ty,tok,depth ‹vnew›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹rdo_lend› ⸫
⍝ ‹cntex› C L of moments: how many live ⟖ of "of" L holds (skipping void moments)
⦃
  ⧖:C,L,of,moments
  ⧗:C̵,L ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,L,of,moments ○ ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,L,of,moments,k,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,L,of,moments,k,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,L,of,moments,k,j,n ⧗:C̵,L,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,w ⧗:C̵,w #4# ‹vf› ⧖:C,wof ⧗:C̵,w #5# ‹vf› ⧖:C,x ⧗:C̵,w ‹vty› ‹shead› ⧖:C,h
        ⧗:C̵,L,of,moments ⧗:k ⧗:wof ⧗:of ᛖ ⧗:h #10198# ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:moments △ ᛖ ⧗:x △ ᛖ ⋎ ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ △ ⊞ ⦄ ∅ ⁼
        ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,L,of,moments,k,j,n ⧗:C̵,k
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹cntex› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,ty
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› ⧗:tok ‹plab› $ reads a $ ⎙̵ ⧗:ty ‹spr›
  $ of an enclosing block; only borrowed moments (⟗, ⟖) are visible inside a block, other values enter it through the stack (§5.1)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹outerr› ⸫

⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,idx,n
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› ⧗:tok ‹plab› $ reads $ ⎙̵ ⧗:idx △ ⊞ ᛁ $ moment(s) back, but only $ ⎙̵ ⧗:n ᛁ
  $ are visible here (data enters a block only through the stack, §5.1)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹readerr› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,ty,mtok
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› ⧗:tok ‹plab› $ reads a void moment: its $ ⎙̵ ⧗:ty ‹spr› $ was already moved out (bound at $ ⎙̵
  ⧗:mtok △ ‹tf› ⧖:a ⧗:mtok #2# ‹tf› ⧖:b ⧗:a,b ‹plpos› $)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹voiderr› ⸫

⍝ a copy of a shadow belongs to the region where the shadow was made
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,depth,strand,mi,m
  ⧗:C̵,m ‹vall› ⧖:C,ty,id,mtok,rg,of,void,ev,ch
  ⧗:rg ⧗:depth ⧗:of #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:rg2
  ⧗:C̵,ty,tok,rg2 ‹vnew› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,v #4# ⧗:of ‹vset› ⧗:m,v ‹vannot›
  ⧗:v,strand
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹rd_copy› ⸫
⍝ quantum: move out, the moment becomes void
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,depth,strand,mi,m
  ⧗:C̵,m ‹vall› ⧖:C,ty,id,mtok,rg,of,void,ev,ch
  ⧗:C̵,ty,id,tok,rg,of #-1# ⧗:ev,ch ‹vrec› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,ty,id,mtok,rg,of △ ⧗:ev,ch ‹vrec› ⧖:C,m2
  ⧗:C̵,strand,mi,m2 ‹lset›
  ⧗:v,strand
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹rd_move› ⸫

⍝ ⍿ⁿ: pick (copy) or move from depth n
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,S,strand,depth,locks
  ⧗:C̵,tok #4# ‹tf› ⧖:C,idx
  ⧗:C̵,S ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,tok,n ⧗:idx ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ‹pickerr› ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⧖:C
  ⧗:n △ ⊟ ⧗:idx ⊟ ⧖:si
  ⧗:C̵,S,si ‹lget› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,v ‹vty› ‹tcopy› ⧖:C,cp
  ⧗:C̵,tok,depth,S,si,v ⧗:cp ⋔ ⦃ ‹pk_copy› ⦄ ⦃ ‹pk_move› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,S2,w
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹trole› ⧖:C,role
  ⧗:C̵,w,role ⧗:role #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ‹vrole› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,w2
  ⧗:C̵,S2,w2 ‹lpush› ⧗:strand
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹g_pick› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,n
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› ⧗:tok ‹plab› $ reaches below the stack (depth $ ⎙̵ ⧗:n ᛁ $)$ ⎙̵ ‹die›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹pickerr› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,depth,S,si,v
  ⧗:C̵,v ‹vall› ⧖:C,ty,id,vtok,rg,of,role,ev,ch
  ⧗:rg ⧗:depth ⧗:of #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:rg2
  ⧗:C̵,ty,tok,rg2 ‹vnew› ⧖:C,w
  ⧗:C̵,w #4# ⧗:of ‹vset› ⧗:v,w ‹vannot›
  ⧗:S,w
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹pk_copy› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,depth,S,si,v
  ⧗:C̵,S ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,S ○ ⧗:si ‹lslice› ⧖:C,A
  ⧗:C̵,S ⧗:si △ ⊞ ⧗:n ‹lslice› ⧖:C,B
  ⧗:C̵,A,B ‹lcat› ⧖:C,S2
  ⧗:C̵,v #-1# ‹vrole› ⧖:C,w
  ⧗:C̵,S2,w
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹pk_move› ⸫

⍝ ⟗ ⟖: entangle (shared or exclusive shadow)
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,S,strand,depth,locks
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹tc0› ⧖:C,x
  ⧗:C̵,S ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,tok,x ⧗:n ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹enterr0› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,S ⧗:n △ ⊟ ‹lget› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C̵,v ‹vty› ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C̵,t ‹tclass› ⧖:C,cl ⧗:C̵,t ‹shead› ⧖:C,h
  ⧗:C̵,tok,t ⧗:cl △ ᛖ ⧗:h #9676# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ‹enterr1› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,S,strand,locks ‹locks› ⧖:C,live
  ⧗:C̵,v △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,id
  ⧗:C̵,live,id ‹lhas› ⧖:C,locked
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:x #10198# ᛖ ⧗:locked ⋎ ‹not› ⧗:tok #8# ‹cfailunless›
  ⧗:S,id,tok ‹excl› 
  ⧗:x,t ‹spre› ⧖:C,sht
  ⧗:C̵,sht,tok,depth ‹vnew› ⧖:C,sh
  ⧗:C̵,sh #4# ⧗:id ‹vset› ⧗:v,sh ‹vannot›
  ⧗:S,sh ‹lpush› ⧗:strand
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹g_entangle› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,tok,x ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› ⧗:x ᚢ $ needs a value to entangle$ ⎙̵ ‹die› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹enterr0› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,tok,t ⧗:C̵,tok ‹cerr› $cannot entangle a $ ⎙̵ ⧗:t ‹spr› ‹die› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹enterr1› ⸫
⍝ ‹excl› C S id tok: an exclusive shadow of id must be unique
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,id,tok
  ⧗:C̵,S ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C̵,S,id,tok ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,S,id,tok,j,n
    ⧗:C̵,S,id,tok,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,S,id,tok,j,n ⧗:C̵,S,j ‹lget› ⧖:C,w ⧗:C̵,w #4# ‹vf› ⧖:C,of ⧗:C̵,w ‹vty› ‹shead› ⧖:C,h
        ⧗:C̵ ⧗:of ⧗:id ᛖ ⧗:h #10198# ᛖ ⋎ ‹not› ⧗:tok #9# ‹cfailunless›
        ⧗:S,id,tok ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹excl› ⸫

⍝ ⫴ ⊛ ⊙: superpose, flip a phase, collapse (§8.3)
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,S,strand,depth,locks
  ⧗:C̵,tok ‹tc0› ⧖:C,x
  ⧗:C̵,tok #4# ‹tf› ⧖:C,idx
  ⧗:x #10996# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ #2# ⦄ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:k
  ⧗:C̵,S,k,tok ○ ‹pop› ⧖:C,S2,vals
  ⧗:C̵,tok,vals ‹agree› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,vals ○ ‹lget› ⧖:C,v0 ⧗:C̵,v0 ‹vty› ⧖:C,t0 ⧗:C̵,t0,tok ‹unwrap› ⧖:C,a
  ⧗:C̵,v0 #6# ‹vf› ⧖:C,ev0 ⧗:C̵,v0 #7# ‹vf› ⧖:C,ch
  ⧗:C̵,tok,vals,a,ev0,ch,x,idx ⧗:k #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ‹sp_sup› ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:tk,vl,aa,ee,cc,xx,ii ⧗:tk,xx,ii,aa,ee ‹sp_one› ⧗:cc ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,rt,ev,ch2
  ⧗:C̵,rt ‹l1› ⧖:C,outs
  ⧗:C̵,S2,outs,tok,depth ‹push› ⧖:C,S3
  ⧗:C̵,S3 △ ⧗:ev,ch2 ‹annot1›
  ⧗:S3,strand
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹g_psi› ⸫

⍝ ‹sp_sup› C tok vals a ev ch: ⫴ on a and the second value
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok,vals,a,ev,ch
