  ⧖:code
  ⧗:C̵,tok,x,vals,ca,cb,neutral,code
  ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ‹gc_same› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:a,b ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⧗:a,b △ ‹chcomb› ⦄ ⦃
