  #4# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:a ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⧗:a ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:z ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⧗:z ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧖:C,ch
  ⧗:C̵,tok,vals ⧗:x #9032# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹gc_launder› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:ch
