  ⧗:C̵,f #3# ‹vf› ⧖:C,rev
  ⧗:C̵ ⧗:rev △ ᛖ ⧗:have △ ᛖ ⋎ ‹not› ⧗:tok #20# ‹cfailunless›
  ⧗:f #5# ‹vf› ⧖:C,ich ⧗:C̵,ich,i ‹lget› ⧖:C,wch
  ⧗:C̵,v #7# ‹vf› ⧖:C,vch
