  ⧗:C̵,tok,i,v,wch ⧗:cs #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹argch› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:v,live,tok ‹moveok›
  ⧗:vals,live,f,tok,i,k
