    ⦃ ⧖:tk,tt ⧗:tk ‹cerr› $a function cannot return a quotation $ ⎙̵ ⧗:tt ‹spr› $ (§9.5)$ ⎙̵ ‹die› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,tok,b ⧗:bl ○ ᛖ ‹not› ⧗:bh ‹isbasecp› ‹not› ⋎ ⧗:rep #-1# ᛖ ⋎ ⧗:bh ‹istvar› ‹not› ⋎ ⧗:bh ‹isrow› ‹not› ⋎ ⧗:bh #10216# ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⋔
    ⦃ ⧖:tk,bb ⧗:tk ‹cerr› $unknown type $ ⎙̵ ⧗:bb ‹spr› $ (Ogham type names must be declared with ⚛, §8.6)$ ⎙̵ ‹die› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
