⦃
  ⧖:C,it,f
  ⧗:C̵,it ‹ndt› ⧖:C,tok
  ⧗:C̵,f ‹rd› ⧖:C,name
  ⧗:C̵ #55# ⧗:name ‹wr› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,f #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,outs
