  ⍝ the header line
  ⧗:C̵ ‹tron› ⧖:C,on
  ⧗:C̵,name,sig,S,f ⧗:on ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:C,name,sig,S,f ⧗:C̵,f #10# ‹vf› ⧖:C,shp ⧗:C̵,sig,shp ⧗:shp #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹cshape› ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:C,sg,sh ⧗:C̵,sh ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,key $fn $ ⎙̵ ⧗:C̵,name ‹spr› $ $ ⎙̵ ⧗:key ‹spr› $  start $ ⎙̵ ⧗:S △ ‹plist› $\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,sig #2# ‹nd› ⧖:C,ssz
