⍝ ‹ctemplate› C i f: a generic function is checked for each instance instead; the trace says so
⦃
  ⧖:C,i,f
  ⧗:C̵ ‹tron› ⧖:C,on
  ⧗:C̵,f ⧗:on ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:C,f ⧗:C̵,f ‹rd› ⧖:C,name ⧗:C̵,f #10# ‹vf› ⧖:C,shp $fn $ ⎙̵ ⧗:C̵,name ‹spr› $ $ ⎙̵ ⧗:shp ‹spr› $  generic: checked for each instance (§9.4)\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ctemplate› ⸫
⍝ ‹cinsts› C: check the instances of generic functions as calls made them (register 57);
⍝ checking one may make more
⦃
  ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,i
    ⧗:C̵ #57# ‹reg› ⧖:C,L ⧗:C̵,L ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
    ⧗:C̵,L,i ⧗:i ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:C,L,i ⧗:C̵,i ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⧖:C,L,i ⧗:C̵,L,i ‹lget› ‹cinst1› ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cinsts› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,g
  ⧗:C̵,g #11# ‹vf› ⧖:C,at ⧗:C̵ #56# ⧗:at ‹wr› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵,g #9# ‹vf› ⧖:C,it ⧗:C̵,it,g ‹cfunction› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C̵ #56# #-1# ‹wr›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cinst1› ⸫

⍝ ‹cinit› T F st trace: the heap for checking: registers, the common types, the token buffer and the tree
⦃
  ⧖:T,F,st,trace
  ⟦ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ○ ⟧
  ‹snew› △ ⧗:trace ‹wr›
  ‹len› ⧖:C,tb ⧗:Ṯ ⧗:C̵ ‹cpyin› #4# ⧗:tb ‹wr› ⧖:C
  ⧗:st̵ ⟗ ⧗:C̵ ‹ccopyst› ⧖:st2,C
  ⧗:st2̵ ⌁̵
  ⍝ the path, as a string
  ⧗:F̱ ᛞ ⧖:pc
  ⧗:pc̵ ⟗ ⧗:C̵ ‹cpath› ⧖:C ⌁̵
  ⧗:C̵ #359# ‹str1› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #10# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  #8484# ‹str1› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #11# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  #8477# ‹str1› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #12# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  #120121# ‹str1› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #13# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  #643# ‹str1› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #14# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  #9676# ‹str1› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #15# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  ‹sbeg› ‹send› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #16# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  #42# ‹str1› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #17# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  #10199# #643# ‹str2› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #18# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  #10198# #643# ‹str2› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #19# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  #9676# #120121# ‹str2› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #20# ⧗:s ‹wr›
  ‹lnew0› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C̵ #7# ⧗:e ‹wr› #8# ⧗:e ‹wr› #9# ⧗:e ‹wr› #57# ⧗:e ‹wr› #58# ⧗:e ‹wr› #59# ⧗:e ‹wr› #56# #-1# ‹wr›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟗ʃ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cinit› ⸫

⍝ ‹ccopyst› st C: copy the tree into the heap (register 5: its base; 24, 25: the tangled items)
⦃
  ⧖:st,C
  ⧗:C̵ ‹len› ⧖:C,ab
  ⧗:sṯ ⧗:C̵ ‹cpyin› #5# ⧗:ab ‹wr› #24# ⧗:sṯ #2# ᚳ ‹wr› #25# ⧗:sṯ ᚴ ‹wr›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹ccopyst› ⸫

⍝ ‹cpath› pc C: the path's code points as an interned string in register 6
⦃
  ⧖:pc,C
  ⧗:C̵ ‹sbeg› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:pc̱,C̵,e ○ ⧗:pc̱ ᚴ
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:pc,C,e,j,n
    ⧗:pc̱,C̵,e,j,n ⧗:j ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:pc,C,e,j,n ⧗:pc̱ ⧗:C̵,e ⧗:pc̱,j ᚳ ‹scp› ⧗:e ⧗:j △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:e ⧖:C ⌁̱ ⧗:C̵,e ‹send› ⧖:C,s ⧗:C̵ #6# ⧗:s ‹wr›
⦄ ⟨⟗⟦ℤ⟧ ⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹cpath› ⸫

⍝ ‹check› C: check every item (its trace goes to the output when register 1 is set)
⦃ △ ‹citems› #2# ‹citems› #3# ‹citems› ‹cinsts› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹check› ⸫
